  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00171",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“别小看我！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Do not look down on me!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00171",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "这声音异常尖利，“只要我有一口气，啊，哪怕一生中只有一回，我也想见见那位老人（大隈）。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The voice was unusually sharp: As long as I still have breath, ah, even if it is only once in my life, I want to meet that old man, Okuma.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00171",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "净往后退可不行啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It will not do to keep backing away.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00171",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "纵使告别人世，我也要保住这个隐藏在小小胸怀中的心愿。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even if I leave this world, I want to preserve this wish hidden in my small heart.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00171",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "在你看来，我是个傻瓜。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In your eyes, I am a fool.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00171",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "帮我解解小手好吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Will you please untie my little hands?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00171",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "要是这个也做不了，还不如掉进池子里淹死好呢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If I cannot even do this, I might as well fall into the pond and drown.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00171",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "啊……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ah...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
